# Ecosystem assets

Follow `.agents/skills/generate-ecosystem-asset/SKILL.md`. One bounded family per task. Package under `assets/ecosystem/<asset-id>/`.

Run `npm run asset:check -- assets/ecosystem/<asset-id>` after every change. Do not hand-edit generated runtime JSON.

Do not mark a package `accepted` without a recorded owner visual verdict. Do not modify simulation rules to justify an asset. Do not replace an existing accepted package without calling that out in the brief.

Continuous traits are runtime parameters; discrete adaptations are authored variants. Family resemblance is required.
